Data: the files in data/ are derived from the CPCB air-quality database as compiled by
Vonter/india-cpcb-aqi, which is under the Open Database License (ODbL 1.0):
http://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1.0/. These derived files are released under the
same licence. Some contents are copyright CPCB. Weather is ERA5 (Copernicus) via Open-Meteo
(CC BY 4.0); fire detections are NASA FIRMS (public domain).

Fonts: fonts/ holds Young Serif and Instrument Sans under the SIL Open Font License
(see fonts/OFL-*.txt).
